; Point IX at the exits of a location
;
; Looks up the location record (#R$9BB1) and sets IX to its exit list minus one
; exit record, and BC to the size of an exit record, ready for the exit walkers
; #R$A124 and #R$A0C8, which add BC before reading.
;
; A Location id
; O:IX Location record + 7
; O:BC 3
@label=SeekExitsOfLocation
c$A0AE CALL $9BB1
@isub=LD BC,EXITS_BIAS
 $A0B1 LD BC,$0007
 $A0B4 ADD IX,BC
@isub=LD BC,EXIT_SIZE
 $A0B6 LD BC,$0003
 $A0B9 RET
